# React frontend

## Rules

- The frontend does NOT generate terrain — it only renders data from Rust
- Tauri calls: always through wrappers in `src/api/world.ts`
- Custom hooks in `src/hooks/` — one hook per feature (`useWorldMap`, `useRegionMap`, `useChunkMap`)
- Map components in `src/components/Map/`
- Generator seed state is `number`; the input may keep `draftSeed` as a string

## Canvas rendering

- `TerrainGrid` → `ImageData` via `src/map/render.ts`
- Biome colors in `src/map/colors.ts` — keep in sync with Rust `TileType`
- Constants (REGION_SIZE, CHUNK_SIZE, resolutions) in `src/utils/constants.ts`
- Generator params: `src/types/terrainParams.ts` (camelCase, mirrored from Rust)

## LOD

- Global: `GlobalMapView` + `generate_global`
- Region: `RegionMapView` + `generate_region`
- Chunk: `ChunkMapView` + `generate_chunk`

## Conventions

- Functional components only
- TypeScript strict mode
- Domain types in `src/types/world.d.ts`
- Do not use `any` — define a type or use `unknown`
